msgstr "已驗證"

msgid "Waiting for interface status."
msgstr "正在等待介面狀態。"

msgid "Unable to read passthrough status. Check that the interface exists, then reconnect it."
msgstr "無法讀取透傳狀態。請確認介面存在，然後重新連線。"

msgid "Passthrough setup failed: "
msgstr "透傳設定失敗："

msgid "Check the dedicated device and IPv6 uplink, then reconnect the interface."
msgstr "請檢查專用裝置和 IPv6 上行鏈路，然後重新連線介面。"

msgid "The tunnel is configured. Downstream internet connectivity has not been verified yet."
msgstr "隧道已設定。下游網際網路連線尚未驗證。"

msgid "Tunnel configuration and downstream internet connectivity are verified."
msgstr "隧道設定與下游網際網路連線皆已驗證。"

msgid "Waiting for IPv6 uplink and tunnel detection. The interface will recover automatically when they are available."
msgstr "正在等待 IPv6 上行鏈路和隧道偵測。可用後介面會自動恢復。"

msgid "Downstream IPv4 settings changed. Update the downstream router static WAN address, mask, and gateway before reconnecting it."
msgstr "下游 IPv4 設定已變更。請在重新連線下游路由器前更新其靜態 WAN 位址、遮罩與閘道。"

msgid "Downstream device"
msgstr "下游裝置"

msgid "Required. Select one dedicated physical port or VLAN for one downstream router."
msgstr "必填。請為一台下游路由器選擇一個專用實體連接埠或 VLAN。"

msgid "IPv6 uplink"
msgstr "IPv6 上行鏈路"

msgid "Optional. Leave empty to detect MAP-E first and DS-Lite second."
msgstr "選填。留空時先偵測 MAP-E，再偵測 DS-Lite。"

msgid "Downstream static WAN configuration"
msgstr "下游靜態 WAN 設定"

msgid "Use the detected address, prefix length, and gateway above to configure the downstream router WAN as static IPv4 before saving this interface."
msgstr "請在儲存此介面前，使用上方偵測到的位址、前綴長度和閘道，將下游路由器 WAN 設為靜態 IPv4。"

msgid "Set downstream DNS manually to public DNS servers. Do not use this OpenWrt router as the downstream DNS server."
msgstr "請手動將下游 DNS 設為公用 DNS 伺服器。不要將此 OpenWrt 路由器用作下游 DNS 伺服器。"

msgid "This dedicated device needs no firewall zone. The passthrough protocol limits forwarding to this device and downstream address."
msgstr "此專用裝置不需要防火牆區域。透傳協定會將轉送限制在此裝置和下游位址。"

msgid "MTU"
msgstr "MTU"

msgid "Optional override for downstream devices that cannot use the detected prefix length."
msgstr "供無法使用偵測到的前綴長度的下游裝置使用的選填覆寫值。"

msgid "Optional override for the downstream router default gateway. OpenWrt answers ARP for this address."
msgstr "下游路由器預設閘道的選填覆寫值。OpenWrt 會回應此位址的 ARP 要求。"

msgid "A dedicated policy-routing table. It must not conflict with an existing table."
msgstr "專用策略路由表。不得與現有路由表衝突。"

msgid "A dedicated source-rule priority. It must not conflict with an existing rule."
msgstr "專用來源規則優先權。不得與現有規則衝突。"

msgid "Do not assign a firewall zone to Flet'H IPoE (Passthrough)."
msgstr "不要為 Flet'H IPoE（透傳）指派防火牆區域。"

msgid "The selected interface or dedicated downstream device is invalid."
msgstr "所選介面或專用下游裝置無效。"

msgid "The policy-routing table or rule priority conflicts with an existing route or rule."
msgstr "策略路由表或規則優先權與現有路由或規則衝突。"

msgid "The AFTR endpoint is invalid or cannot be resolved over IPv6."
msgstr "AFTR 端點無效，或無法透過 IPv6 解析。"

msgid "The required fw4/nftables component is unavailable."
msgstr "所需的 fw4/nftables 元件無法使用。"

msgid "The dedicated downstream device already has an IPv4 address."
msgstr "專用下游裝置已擁有 IPv4 位址。"

msgid "The selected IPv6 uplink has no usable local IPv6 address."
msgstr "所選 IPv6 上行鏈路沒有可用的本機 IPv6 位址。"

msgid "No MAP-E or DS-Lite provider was detected."
msgstr "未偵測到 MAP-E 或 DS-Lite 供應商。"

msgid "The calculated downstream IPv4 settings are invalid."
msgstr "計算出的下游 IPv4 設定無效。"

msgid "OpenWrt could not enable the required downstream ARP setting."
msgstr "OpenWrt 無法啟用所需的下游 ARP 設定。"

msgid "OpenWrt could not install the required nftables forwarding rules."
msgstr "OpenWrt 無法安裝所需的 nftables 轉送規則。"

msgid "OpenWrt could not create the IPv6 tunnel or local tunnel address."
msgstr "OpenWrt 無法建立 IPv6 隧道或本機隧道位址。"

msgid "OpenWrt could not install the dedicated downstream route or policy rule."
msgstr "OpenWrt 無法安裝專用下游路由或策略規則。"

msgid "OpenWrt could not save the configured runtime state."
msgstr "OpenWrt 無法儲存已設定的執行時狀態。"

msgid "The tunnel setup did not complete."
msgstr "隧道設定未完成。"

msgid "Applied tunnel state"
msgstr "已套用的隧道狀態"

msgid "Detecting downstream settings..."
msgstr "正在偵測下游設定..."

msgid "Unable to detect downstream settings: "
msgstr "無法偵測下游設定："

msgid "Update the IPv6 uplink or AFTR endpoint, then try again."
msgstr "請更新 IPv6 上行鏈路或 AFTR 端點，然後重試。"

msgid "Downstream settings are detected for the current unsaved configuration. They are not applied until this interface is saved and connected."
msgstr "已針對目前未儲存的設定偵測到下游設定。在儲存並連線此介面前不會套用。"

msgid "Not configured"
msgstr "未設定"

msgid "Retry detection"
msgstr "重新偵測"
